#: source/concepts/sensors/contact_sensor.rst:7
msgid "Contact Sensor"
msgstr "接触传感器"

#: source/concepts/sensors/contact_sensor.rst:9
msgid ""
"A :class:`~sensors.ContactSensor` aggregates contacts on one or more rigid "
"bodies into batched force measurements. The sensor scope is defined by "
":attr:`~sensors.ContactSensorCfg.prim_path`: each matched body becomes one "
"sensor body in every environment."
msgstr ""
":class:`~sensors.ContactSensor` 将一个或多个刚体上的接触汇总为批量力测量。传感器范围由 "
":attr:`~sensors.ContactSensorCfg.prim_path` 定义：每个匹配的刚体都会成为各环境中的一个传感器刚体。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/contact_sensor.rst:13
msgid "A contact sensor reporting total and filtered contact forces"
msgstr "报告总接触力和过滤后接触力的接触传感器"

#: source/concepts/sensors/contact_sensor.rst:19
msgid "Net and filtered forces"
msgstr "合力与过滤后的力"

#: source/concepts/sensors/contact_sensor.rst:21
msgid ""
":attr:`~sensors.ContactSensorData.net_normal_forces_w` is the aggregate "
"normal force acting on each sensor body in the world frame. It includes "
"contact with every body in the scene."
msgstr ""
":attr:`~sensors.ContactSensorData.net_normal_forces_w` "
"是作用于各传感器刚体的法向合力，以世界坐标系表示。它包含与场景中所有刚体接触产生的力。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/contact_sensor.rst:24
msgid ""
"When supported by the backend and enabled with ``track_friction_forces``, "
":attr:`~sensors.ContactSensorData.net_friction_forces_w` reports the "
"aggregate friction force. The total force is therefore"
msgstr ""
"如果后端支持且启用了 ``track_friction_forces`` ， "
":attr:`~sensors.ContactSensorData.net_friction_forces_w` 会报告摩擦合力。因此，总力为"

#: source/concepts/sensors/contact_sensor.rst:28
msgid ""
"\\boldsymbol{f}_{total} = \\boldsymbol{f}_{normal} + "
"\\boldsymbol{f}_{friction}."
msgstr ""
"\\boldsymbol{f}_{total} = \\boldsymbol{f}_{normal} + "
"\\boldsymbol{f}_{friction}."

#: source/concepts/sensors/contact_sensor.rst:32
msgid ""
"On Newton, OvPhysX, and Isaac Sim PhysX 6.2 or later, "
":attr:`~sensors.ContactSensorData.net_forces_w` reports this total, "
"including friction even when ``track_friction_forces=False``. Isaac Sim "
"PhysX 6.1 returns ``net_normal_forces_w`` from ``net_forces_w`` with a "
"warning. Use the explicit normal and friction properties when the split "
"matters."
msgstr ""
"在 Newton、OvPhysX 和 Isaac Sim PhysX 6.2 "
"及以上版本中，:attr:`~sensors.ContactSensorData.net_forces_w` 返回总接触力；即使 "
"``track_friction_forces=False``，其中也包含摩擦力。Isaac Sim PhysX 6.1 的 "
"``net_forces_w`` 则返回 ``net_normal_forces_w`` "
"并给出警告。需要区分法向力和摩擦力时，应使用明确对应各分量的属性。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/contact_sensor.rst:38
msgid ""
"Set :attr:`~sensors.ContactSensorCfg.filter_prim_paths_expr` when forces "
"from specific collision partners are also needed. "
":attr:`~sensors.ContactSensorData.normal_force_matrix_w` and "
":attr:`~sensors.ContactSensorData.friction_force_matrix_w` retain one entry "
"per configured filter expression. The corresponding "
":attr:`~sensors.ContactSensorData.force_matrix_w` reports normal plus "
"friction on Newton, OvPhysX, and Isaac Sim PhysX 6.2 or later, regardless of"
" ``track_friction_forces``."
msgstr ""
"若还需要获取来自指定接触对象的力，可设置 "
":attr:`~sensors.ContactSensorCfg.filter_prim_paths_expr` "
"。:attr:`~sensors.ContactSensorData.normal_force_matrix_w` 和 "
":attr:`~sensors.ContactSensorData.friction_force_matrix_w` "
"为每个配置的过滤表达式保留一项数据。在 Newton、OvPhysX 和 Isaac Sim PhysX 6.2 及以上版本中，对应的 "
":attr:`~sensors.ContactSensorData.force_matrix_w` 返回法向力与摩擦力之和，不受 "
"``track_friction_forces`` 设置影响。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/contact_sensor.rst:45
msgid ""
"Summing a force matrix over its filter dimension reconstructs the "
"corresponding aggregate force only when the filters cover every contacting "
"object."
msgstr "只有过滤条件覆盖了所有接触物体时，沿过滤维度对力矩阵求和才能还原对应的合力。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/contact_sensor.rst:48
msgid ""
"Body-level filtering supports a many-to-one relationship: ``prim_path`` must"
" resolve to one sensor body per environment when filters are configured. "
"Define one sensor per source body when separate filtered forces are "
"required, for example one sensor for each foot. Newton additionally supports"
" shape-level sensing and filtering through ``sensor_shape_prim_expr`` and "
"``filter_shape_prim_expr``."
msgstr ""
"刚体级过滤支持多对一关系：配置过滤条件时， ``prim_path`` "
"必须在每个环境中解析为一个传感器刚体。如果需要分别获取过滤后的力，请为每个源刚体定义一个传感器，例如每只脚各一个。Newton 还支持通过 "
"``sensor_shape_prim_expr`` 和 ``filter_shape_prim_expr`` 在碰撞形状级别进行感知和过滤。"

