msgstr "将配置添加到 :class:`~isaaclab.scene.InteractiveSceneCfg` ："

#: source/concepts/sensors/contact_sensor.rst:74
msgid ""
"``update_period=0.0`` samples every physics step. ``history_length`` stores "
"earlier force samples. Enable optional buffers only when they are needed. "
"Their backend support differs:"
msgstr ""
"``update_period=0.0`` 表示每个物理步都采样。 ``history_length`` "
"用于存储历史力样本。仅在需要时启用可选缓冲区，各后端的支持情况不同："

#: source/concepts/sensors/contact_sensor.rst:77
msgid ""
"Isaac Sim PhysX 6.2 or later supports pose, filtered contact-point, and "
"aggregate or filtered friction-force tracking. Isaac Sim PhysX 6.1 supports "
"only filtered friction-force tracking."
msgstr ""
"Isaac Sim PhysX 6.2 及以上版本支持位姿跟踪、过滤后的接触点跟踪，以及聚合或过滤后的摩擦力跟踪。Isaac Sim PhysX 6.1"
" 的摩擦力跟踪仅支持过滤后的结果。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/contact_sensor.rst:79
msgid ""
"OvPhysX supports filtered contact-point and aggregate or filtered friction-"
"force tracking. Pose tracking is supported for a single sensor body per "
"environment."
msgstr "OvPhysX 支持过滤后的接触点跟踪，以及聚合或过滤后的摩擦力跟踪。位姿跟踪仅支持每个环境中只有一个传感器刚体的情况。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/contact_sensor.rst:81
msgid ""
"Newton supports filtered contact-point and aggregate or filtered friction-"
"force tracking, but not pose tracking."
msgstr "Newton 支持过滤后的接触点，以及摩擦合力或过滤后的摩擦力跟踪，但不支持位姿跟踪。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/contact_sensor.rst:84
msgid ""
"Filtered contact points and force matrices require filters. Aggregate "
"friction on Newton, OvPhysX, and Isaac Sim PhysX 6.2 or later works without "
"filters. OvPhysX and Isaac Sim PhysX 6.2 or later require a positive "
"``max_contact_data_count_per_prim`` only for contact points; their aggregate"
" and filtered forces do not depend on detailed contact capacity. Isaac Sim "
"PhysX 6.1 also requires this capacity for filtered friction. OvPhysX warns "
"and truncates detailed contacts when capacity is exceeded; increase the "
"configured capacity before recreating the sensor to retain all contact "
"points."
msgstr ""
"过滤后的接触点和力矩阵需要配置过滤器。Newton、OvPhysX 和 Isaac Sim PhysX 6.2 "
"及以上版本无需过滤器即可获取聚合摩擦力。OvPhysX 和 Isaac Sim PhysX 6.2 及以上版本仅在获取接触点时要求 "
"``max_contact_data_count_per_prim`` 为正值；其聚合力和过滤后的力不受详细接触数据容量限制。Isaac Sim "
"PhysX 6.1 的过滤摩擦力也需要这一容量。超出容量时，OvPhysX "
"会给出警告并截断详细接触数据；要保留所有接触点，需先增大配置的容量，再重新创建传感器。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/contact_sensor.rst:91
msgid ""
"Contact positions are averaged over each sensor/filter pair and are ``NaN`` "
"when the pair has no contacts. Isaac Sim PhysX and OvPhysX also reset "
"contact positions to ``NaN``. Filtered friction forces sum the pair's "
"friction forces and are zero without contact. On Isaac Sim PhysX 6.1, "
"contact points and friction anchors can have different counts."
msgstr ""
"接触位置是每组传感器/过滤器配对中所有接触位置的平均值；该配对没有接触时，结果为 ``NaN``。Isaac Sim PhysX 和 OvPhysX "
"也会将无接触时的位置重置为 ``NaN``。过滤摩擦力为该配对的摩擦力之和，无接触时为零。在 Isaac Sim PhysX 6.1 "
"中，接触点与摩擦锚点的数量可能不同。"

