#: source/concepts/sensors/contact_sensor.rst:134
msgid ""
"Supported optional buffers are ``None`` unless their matching tracking "
"option or filter is enabled. Normal, friction, and total force histories add"
" an ``H`` dimension after ``E``, with the newest sample at index zero. "
"Reading aggregate friction on Isaac Sim PhysX 6.1 raises "
"``NotImplementedError``. The compatibility alias ``friction_forces_w`` "
"returns the aggregate on Newton, OvPhysX, and Isaac Sim PhysX 6.2 or later; "
"on Isaac Sim PhysX 6.1 it returns ``friction_force_matrix_w`` with a "
"warning. Reading pose data on Newton raises ``NotImplementedError``."
msgstr ""
"受支持的可选缓冲区在相应跟踪选项或过滤器启用前均为 ``None``。法向力、摩擦力和总接触力的历史数据会在 ``E`` 之后增加一个 ``H`` "
"维度，最新样本位于索引零。Isaac Sim PhysX 6.1 不提供聚合摩擦力，读取时会抛出 "
"``NotImplementedError``。兼容别名 ``friction_forces_w`` 在 Newton、OvPhysX 和 Isaac "
"Sim PhysX 6.2 及以上版本中返回聚合摩擦力；在 Isaac Sim PhysX 6.1 中则返回 "
"``friction_force_matrix_w`` 并给出警告。在 Newton 中读取位姿数据会抛出 "
"``NotImplementedError``。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/contact_sensor.rst:147
msgid ""
"Use ``debug_vis=True`` while validating body expressions and filter "
"partners. The visualization shows sensor contacts but does not change the "
"reported data."
msgstr "验证刚体表达式和过滤对象时，可使用 ``debug_vis=True`` 。可视化会显示传感器接触，但不会改变报告的数据。"

